{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/557","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/557/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/557/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/557/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/557","id":440631429,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0NDA2MzE0Mjk=","number":557,"title":"Wrong description for unit-tests","user":{"login":"anetbnd","id":50142686,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTQyNjg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50142686?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd","html_url":"https://github.com/anetbnd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anetbnd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1141241826,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjQxODI2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1141243328,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjQzMzI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"E08050","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2019-05-06T10:18:51Z","updated_at":"2019-05-06T14:14:35Z","closed_at":"2019-05-06T14:13:53Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hello\r\n\r\nwhen reading the file https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/blob/master/README.unittests.rst I had the feeling, that the test-framework tries to discover the database configuration, which should be run by itself. The following sentence implies this for me:\r\n\r\n```\r\nThe test suite will attempt to run a subset of tests against various database backends, including Postgresql and MySQL. It uses the database URLs in the [db] section of setup.cfg to locate a URL for particular backend types.\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever when I tried to run tests against my postgres configuration, which uses exactly the URL given in the setup.cfg for postgres, all postgres tests are always skipped. I spent hours on debugging this until I found out, that by default only the default-configuration (sqlite) is run, all other configurations are not taken automatically into account. \r\n\r\nTo run postgres tests, I had to first install `nose` and to start the tests with `python run_tests.py --db postgresql` instead of `python setup.py test`. This should be clearly explained in the unit-test description file, to prevent contributors from wasting a lot of time, just to figure out, why certain tests are skipped.","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/557/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}